# API contract

`shared/schemas.ts` is the source of truth. Do not invent response fields in components or query functions.

1. Change the Zod schema.
2. Run `bun run api:generate`.
3. Call the API through `fetchTransactions`, `fetchCurrencies`, or `fetchCountries` in `src/shared/api/client.ts`.

Those functions only accept paths from `src/shared/api/schema.d.ts` and parse the body with the Zod schema. Do not hand-edit `shared/openapi.json` or `schema.d.ts`.
